stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    %% This chart describes a HeartbeatTransaction owned by the coordinator.
    %% Transition labels identify received events; notes describe their effects.

    [*] --> STOPPED: transaction constructed
    STOPPED --> COORDINATOR: start() called

    COORDINATOR --> COORDINATOR: HeartbeatTickMsg received

    note right of COORDINATOR
        Broadcast HeartbeatMsg.
        Schedule the next HeartbeatTickMsg.
    end note

    %% Once the owning Replica has crashed, scheduled ticks can no longer cause
    %% heartbeats to be broadcast.
    COORDINATOR --> [*]: owning Replica crashes
